  "id": "remote-association",
  "term": "remote association",
  "definition": "Remote association is the ability to connect ideas or elements that seem unrelated and form new relationships between them. In psychology, it is linked to creativity because stronger remote associative ability is associated with producing more unusual and novel ideas.",
